---@field nccHubUri? string URI of the NCC Hub the route is advertised by in format "projects/{project}/locations/global/hubs/{hub}". PEERING_SUBNET and PEERING_DYNAMIC routes that are advertised by NCC Hub only.
---@field originatingRouteDisplayName? string For PEERING_SUBNET, PEERING_STATIC and PEERING_DYNAMIC routes, the name of the originating SUBNET/STATIC/DYNAMIC route.
---@field priority? number Priority of the route.
---@field advertisedRouteNextHopUri? string For ADVERTISED routes, the URI of their next hop, i.e. the URI of the hybrid endpoint (VPN tunnel, Interconnect attachment, NCC router appliance) the advertised prefix is advertised through, or URI of the source peered network. Deprecated in favor of the next_hop_uri field, not used in new tests.
---@field routeScope? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.RouteInfoRouteScopeEnum|string Indicates where route is applicable. Deprecated, routes with NCC_HUB scope are not included in the trace in new tests.
---@field advertisedRouteSourceRouterUri? string For ADVERTISED dynamic routes, the URI of the Cloud Router that advertised the corresponding IP prefix in format "projects/{project}/regions/{region}/routers/{router}".
---@field srcIpRange? string Source IP address range of the route. POLICY_BASED routes only.
---@field nccHubRouteUri? string For PEERING_SUBNET and PEERING_DYNAMIC routes that are advertised by NCC Hub, the URI of the corresponding route in NCC Hub's routing table. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/global/hubs/{hub}/routeTables/{route_table}/routes/{route}`
---@field networkUri? string URI of a VPC network where route is located in format "projects/{project}/global/networks/{network}".
---@field displayName? string Name of a route.
---@field srcPortRanges? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.StringList Source port ranges of the route. POLICY_BASED routes only.
---@field destIpRange? string Destination IP range of the route.
---@field destPortRanges? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.StringList Destination port ranges of the route. POLICY_BASED routes only.
---@field routeType? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.RouteInfoRouteTypeEnum|string Type of route.
---@field instanceTags? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.StringList Instance tags of the route.
---@field nextHopType? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.RouteInfoNextHopTypeEnum|string Type of next hop.
---@field nccSpokeUri? string URI of the destination NCC Spoke in format "projects/{project}/locations/{location}/spokes/{spoke}" (regional) or "projects/{project}/locations/global/spokes/{spoke}" (global). PEERING_SUBNET and PEERING_DYNAMIC routes that are advertised by NCC Hub only.
---@field protocols? gcp.unstable.networkmanagement_v1beta1.StringList Protocols of the route. POLICY_BASED routes only.
---@field region? string Region of the route. DYNAMIC, PEERING_DYNAMIC, POLICY_BASED and ADVERTISED routes only. If set for POLICY_BASED route, this is a region of VLAN attachments for Cloud Interconnect the route applies to. If set to "all" for POLICY_BASED route, the route applies to VLAN attachments of Cloud Interconnect in all regions.

